# doi: TO_BE_ASSIGNED (Zenodo reserved DOI)
abstract: >-
  Acquisition, calibration, digital-twin, physics-structured learning, and
  evaluation tools for estimating camera displacement and relative trajectory
  from continuous IMU streams. Images are used only for calibration, training
  supervision, and evaluation; inference is IMU-only.
keywords:
  - inertial odometry
  - camera motion
  - IMU
  - digital twin
  - measurement uncertainty
  - observability
